            "id": "levelled_description_c04602fd51cd",
            "level": {
              "value": 17
            },
            "description": {
              "value": "Before your soul returned to the Material Plane, you interacted with a host of other souls on their way to the Boneyard. One of these acquaintances owes you a favor. You can temporarily summon it to come to your aid, and it appears as a swirling mass of ectoplasm with indiscernible features and a translucent dagger, the favored weapon of Pharasma. This functions as spiritual guardian, which you can cast once per day as a divine innate spell, but you don't need to worship a deity to do so."
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
